      "definition": "A person you know well and like.",
      "forms": { "plural": "οι φίλοι", "feminine": "η φίλη" },
      "examples": [{ "text": "Ο Νίκος είναι ο καλύτερός μου φίλος.", "translation": "Nikos is my best friend." }],
      "tags": ["people"]
    },
    {
