      "gender": "neuter",
      "definition": "The clear liquid that falls as rain and that people drink.",
      "forms": { "plural": "τα νερά" },
      "examples": [{ "text": "Ένα ποτήρι νερό, παρακαλώ.", "translation": "A glass of water, please." }],
      "tags": ["food"]
    },
    {
