      "gender": "feminine",
      "definition": "The large body of salt water that covers much of the earth.",
      "forms": { "plural": "οι θάλασσες" },
      "examples": [{ "text": "Το καλοκαίρι πηγαίνουμε στη θάλασσα.", "translation": "In the summer we go to the seaside." }],
