      "examples": [{ "text": "Είμαι κουρασμένος σήμερα.", "translation": "I'm tired today." }],
      "notes": "Irregular. Greek verbs are listed in the first person singular, so είμαι literally means \"I am\".",
      "tags": ["verbs"]
    },
